    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 7 Oldtown, a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious and beautifully presented turn-key family home with an excellent upgraded B energy rating.Internally, the property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 167 sq. m., with a layout ideally suited to modern family living. On entering, a welcoming entrance hallway leads to the bright and spacious ground floor, which comprises a comfortable sitting room, separate dining room and modern fitted kitchen, providing excellent spaces for both everyday living and entertaining. To the rear, the large sunroom is a particular feature of the property, enjoying excellent natural light and offering a bright and versatile additional living space. A convenient ground-floor bedroom with ensuite completes the accommodation on this level, providing excellent flexibility for family or guest use.Upstairs, there are four spacious bedrooms, including an impressive master suite. The generous bedroom accommodation provides excellent flexibility for family living, guests, or additional recreational space, further enhancing the appeal and versatility of this substantial home.To the rear, the property enjoys a substantial, private and enclosed south-facing garden, beautifully landscaped with mature planting, raised beds and paved patio areas, providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining and to the front an enclosed brick paved driveway offering off-street parking for multiple cars. Conveniently located 1 km approx. from the heart of Cavan town the property is accessible to all amenities and services by foot, car, or local transport links. Overall, an excellent opportunity to acquire a significant family home in a mature residential area.Viewing is highly recommended by the sole selling agent by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nTiled flooring, coving, carpet to the first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 6.08m x 3.49m\nTiled flooring, wanders stove insert, sliding pocket door, coving.\n\nDining Room - 3.38m x 3.07m\nTiled flooring, recessed lighting, sliding pocket doors (x2), coving.\n\nKitchen - 4.64m x 3.64m\nTiled flooring, modern fitted kitchen wit breakfast bar, recessed lighting, coving\n\nUtility Room - 2.87m x 1.73m\nTiled flooring, fitted units, door to rear.\n\nSunroom - 5.45m x 4.86m\nTiled flooring, recessed lighting, slding patio doors.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.59m x 2.44m\nTiled flooring, coving.\n\nEnsuite - 2.42m x 0.85m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, shower.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.00m x 3.51m\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, coving.\n\nEnsuite - 2.45m x 1.54m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.01m x 3.51m\nSolid wooden flooring, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.76m x 2.75m\nSolid wooden flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.16m x 1.85m\nCarpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.69m x 1.79m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, shower over bath, recessed lighting, coving.\n\n"
